      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HER PRESENCE (4) has been far from disgraced when midfield from back row draws at her last two outings. Race fit now and is much better served by this barrier so should get her chance. SUN PUBLISHER NZ (10) did some work but kept finding to finish third at this circuit and distance last week, his fourth pacing on the trot. Won't spend a penny from this draw but luck may play a role on the bell lap. If he gets the gaps he could get the job done. OFFICIAL ROCK (3) came from wider for a 3.4m fourth at her most recent appearance. Had recorded back-to-back placings here prior so is going well. FLYING RUMOUR (11) must be respected after coming from this barrier to score last start.",
